# Gradle and Kotlin build output. Regenerable, machine-specific, and large — a
# 1.4 MB `build/` tree turned up as "untracked files, please commit" the first time
# the suite ran here, which is how this file came to exist. None of it is source.
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/

# Android Studio / IntelliJ, and the SDK path a developer's machine writes.
# `local.properties` in particular is a filesystem path from someone's laptop; it
# is per-machine by definition and breaks every other machine that reads it.
.idea/
*.iml
local.properties
captures/

# Signing material. Nothing here is used by the CI lane — it builds unsigned — but
# a keystore accidentally added to a PUBLIC repository cannot be un-published, so
# the ignore comes before anyone needs it rather than after.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
